    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2>The Game Is A Simple 2.5d Platform Action Game. The player can move and jump. That and solve puzzles using little gimmicks in the stages.<br>Some of the stages are a bit meaner than others, but you'll get through them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2>The only controls in the game are A, D and Space on the keyboard; the UI controls use the mouse, but the basic parts of the game can be played with one hand.<br><br>The objective of each stage is simple: manipulate the spheres to reach the red glowing tiles, that's it.",
